---
title: "member_registration (stem-system: Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_session: server action invoked
    q_check_session --> q_error_unauth: no authenticated session
    q_check_session --> q_validate_input: session valid, user_id extracted
    q_error_unauth --> [*]: return error
    q_validate_input --> q_error_validation: zod validation fails (status, generation, student_number)
    q_validate_input --> q_check_existing: input valid
    q_error_validation --> [*]: return validation error
    q_check_existing --> q_error_duplicate: member already registered for this supabase_auth_user_id
    q_check_existing --> q_insert: no existing member
    q_error_duplicate --> [*]: return error (already registered)
    q_insert --> q_get_discord: insert into members table (supabase_auth_user_id, status, generation, student_number, discord_uid, discord_username)
    q_get_discord --> q_sync_roles: fire-and-forget Discord bot role sync
    q_sync_roles --> [*]: return success, revalidatePath

    note right of q_validate_input
        INV-001: status must be 0 (junior high), 1 (high school), or 2 (OB/OG)
        INV-002: generation must be a positive integer
        INV-003: discord_uid and discord_username are extracted from Supabase auth metadata
    end note

    note right of q_insert
        INV-004: supabase_auth_user_id is unique per member (primary key)
        INV-005: member starts with is_admin = false
    end note
